// An agent works from the beginning of a turn to that turn's end: facts that the record's own lines make and end (the
// engine page's move 6, piece 1; paper-research N-1446 p3020, 8). A program reads `working` with `decide`, through a
// decision whose rules read it (piece 2); a policy line reads it as any fact, as a project's `copy-answers` (p3020, 1).

Fact working Identified by agent

// its turn begins: the machine's own `turn_began` line, which coordd writes as the turn's first input is taken
// (core.rs begin_turn; docket-edge6 N-1446 p3082, p3099)
Event turn_began
  Related to agent
  Creates working(agent)

// the turn ends, as it ended or cut short (its process exited, or its session started again)
Event turn_ended
  Related to agent
  Terminates working(agent)
Event turn_cut
  Related to agent
  Terminates working(agent)
